<title>POLAND: GPRD Q2 net falls to PLN 3.7 mln.</title>
<headline>GPRD Q2 net falls to PLN 3.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPRD preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.05 vs	6.27</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.71 vs	5.91</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.71 vs	4.93</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 40.06 vs     31.34</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  35.99 vs     25.20</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.14 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.49 vs	0.35</p>
<p>    investment				 6.26 vs	2.84</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			   1.70 vs	3.03 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     1.23 vs	2.92 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				   1.23 vs	1.94</p>
<p>    net sales				 50.25 vs     36.91</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  52.20 vs     34.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.00 vs	0.98</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.30 vs	0.43</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.83 vs	0.53</p>
<p>    investment				 7.45 vs	7.68</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
